A story of when good food... goes bad!

2
00:07:54,782 --> 00:08:00,782
Foodfight! is a adventure, comedy, action film directed by Lawrence Kasanoff.

3
00:11:52,173 --> 00:11:58,173
The evil Brand X joins a supermarket that becomes a city after closing time.

4
00:15:49,565 --> 00:15:55,565
Dex Dogtective (voice), played by Charlie Sheen.

5
00:19:46,956 --> 00:19:52,956
Sunshine Goodness (voice), played by Hilary Duff.

6
