10
00:39:33,913 --> 00:39:39,913
is a 2012 American animated adventure comedy film co-produced and directed by Lawrence Kasanoff (in his feature directorial debut), who wrote
the screenplay with Brent Friedman, Rebecca Swanson and Sean Catherine Derek from a story Kasanoff conceived with Joshua Wexler.

11
00:43:31,304 --> 00:43:37,304
The film features the voices of Charlie Sheen, Wayne Brady, Hilary
Duff, Eva Longoria, Larry Miller, and Christopher Lloyd.

12
00:47:28,695 --> 00:47:34,695
takes place in the "Marketropolis" supermarket, which, after closing time, transforms into
a city inhabited by "Ikes", personifications of well-known food mascots.

13
00:51:26,086 --> 00:51:32,086
The story follows a cereal brand mascot, Dex Dogtective, who, along with his best friend Daredevil Dan, join forces with their
fellow "Ikes" to fight against the forces of the evil Brand X, who threaten to take over the entire supermarket.

14
00:55:23,478 --> 00:55:29,478
After raising tens of millions of dollars in funding, Foodfight!

15
00:59:20,869 --> 00:59:26,869
had a troubled and much-delayed production.

16
01:03:18,260 --> 01:03:24,260
The film was originally scheduled for a Christmas 2003 theatrical release; however, this failed to
materialize, and later planned release dates in 2005 and 2007 were also missed.

17
01:07:15,652 --> 01:07:21,652
By September 2011, after the producers defaulted on a loan, creditors auctioned off the
film's assets and all associated rights to Fireman's Fund Insurance Company.

18
01:11:13,043 --> 01:11:19,043
In 2012, the film had a modest release, being
direct-to-video in most territories.

19
01:15:10,434 --> 01:15:16,434
Its critical reception was overwhelmingly negative, with most criticism directed
towards the animation, humor, story and excessive product placement.

20
01:19:07,826 --> 01:19:13,826
It has often been discussed as one of the worst films of all time.

21
01:23:05,217 --> 01:23:11,217
The film explores themes of supermarket, fight,
product placement, food, food fight.

22
01:27:02,608 --> 01:27:08,608
The tone is lighthearted.
